#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

BASE="$HOME/.richmackos"
CHANNELS="$BASE/youtube-channels.json"


show_help() {
cat <<'HELP'
RichmackOS YouTube Knowledge Engine

Usage:

  richmack youtube COMMAND [OPTIONS]


CHANNEL MANAGEMENT

  channels
      List configured YouTube channels.

  add-channel KEY "NAME" URL
      Add a YouTube channel.

  remove-channel KEY
      Remove a configured channel.


INGESTION

  sync --limit N
      Sync the newest N videos from every configured channel.

  sync --channel KEY --limit N
      Sync only one channel.

  status
      Show YouTube transcript ingestion status.


KNOWLEDGE ENGINE

  knowledge build CHANNEL
      Build structured knowledge for one channel.

  knowledge build CHANNEL --limit N
      Build the newest N indexed videos.

  knowledge build --all
      Build every configured channel.

  knowledge build CHANNEL --force --no-summary
      Rebuild deterministic data without rerunning Gemma summaries.

  knowledge status
      Show structured knowledge status.

  knowledge videos CHANNEL
      List indexed videos.

  knowledge topics CHANNEL
      Show extracted concepts and topics.


SEARCH / RAG

  search QUERY
      Search downloaded transcript text.

  ask CHANNEL "QUESTION"
      Ask a scoped RAG question.

  ask CHANNEL --latest "QUESTION"
      Restrict the question to the latest transcript.


SUMMARIES

  summarize CHANNEL --limit N
      Summarize recent videos from one channel.

  summarize --all --limit N
      Summarize every configured channel.

  summarize --all --limit N --combined
      Generate channel summaries plus one combined briefing.


EVIDENCE CHAT

  chat CHANNEL
      Open transcript-first interactive evidence chat.


DISCOVERY

  workflow
      Show the recommended RichmackOS YouTube workflow.

  examples
      Show example commands and example chat questions.


CHAT FEATURES

  Channel isolation
  Video routing
  Transcript-first retrieval
  Evidence citations
  Follow-up video memory
  Per-video channel analysis
  Cross-video synthesis
  Claim attribution


INSIDE YOUTUBE CHAT

  /help
      Show interactive help.

  /video
      Show the current selected video.

  /sources
      Show evidence used for the previous answer.

  /clear
      Clear video/follow-up context.

  /quit
      Exit chat.


QUICK START

  richmack youtube sync --limit 3

  richmack youtube knowledge build tim-ferriss --limit 5

  richmack youtube knowledge videos tim-ferriss

  richmack youtube knowledge topics tim-ferriss

  richmack youtube chat tim-ferriss


COMMON CHAT QUESTIONS

  what is the 4x4 protocol?

  what else is mentioned?

  what are the main topics across the latest videos?

  what is the most unusual claim discussed?

  what else did they say about it?

  tell me what they said about knights templar


MORE HELP

  richmack youtube workflow

  richmack youtube examples

  man richmack
HELP
}


show_workflow() {
cat <<'WORKFLOW'
